# TEMPLATE ONLY. Put real values in an ACL-protected file under local-data/secrets.
# Never copy SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY/service_role from Clips-Imagens into Postiz.
# Use a direct or session pooler endpoint copied from the project's Connect panel.
POSTIZ_DATABASE_HOST=db.PROJECT_REFERENCE.supabase.co
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postiz_app:URL_ENCODED_PASSWORD@db.PROJECT_REFERENCE.supabase.co:5432/postgres?schema=postiz&sslmode=require&sslaccept=strict&connection_limit=3"
# Keep REDIS_URL absent. The local profile uses PostgreSQL for temporary state.
# LOCAL_TOKEN_KEY stays on Windows; do not put it in Supabase.
